"view.eventinputscreen.help"                     = "When creating a new event, you must provide a title and an optional short description.\n\nYou can specify a location, but this is not required. The procedure is the same as entering a radix. First you choose the country and then the location. Enigma automatically fills in the longitude and latitude, but you can override these values.\n\nUnder Date & Time, you enter the date and optionally the time. By default, the current day and time are selected. If you do not know the time, it is best to use 12:00.\n\nOnce the details are filled in, you can click the 'Create' button. The new event will then automatically appear in the list of events.";
